    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Operations and alert rules",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "[Open alert rules](/grafana/alerting/list) \u00b7 [Runbook](https://github.com/MindulMendul/mindul-ai-infra/blob/main/ops/README.md)\n\nBackups are encrypted local copies. Off-server storage and external notifications have not been configured. Backup: daily 03:20 KST; restore check: Sunday 04:00 KST; maintenance: Sunday 04:30 KST; probes: every five minutes."
      }
    }
